  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Living Conditions for Development in Western China</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to understand global challenges such as good governance, socio-economic development, poverty alleviation, social security, innovation and climate change mitigation in China&apos;s Western Region. It will produce high-quality and reliable information for policy makers&apos; efforts to eradicate poverty, with a particual focus on the Sustainable Development Goals. It is implemented by Chinese Academy of Science and Technology for Development and FAFO jointly.</narrative>
  </description>
